  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction, <math><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> products, when the concentration of <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> both were doubled, the rate of the reaction increased from <math><mn>0.3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> to <math><mn>2.4</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> When the concentration of <math><mi>A</mi></math> alone is doubled, the rate increased from <math><mn>0.3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> to <math><mn>0.6</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Which one of the following statements is correct?",
