  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br /><br />Initial <math><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mrow></math> ...(i)<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn></math> ...(ii)<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn></math> ...(iii)<br /><br />From (i) <math><mo>&#247;</mo></math> (iii)<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />(ii) <math><mo>&#247;</mo></math> (iii)<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />The order of reaction w.r.t. <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and w.r.t. <math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />Total order of reaction <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
